    "A new topic has a \"Send a test notification\" button, so you can see a notification arrive without a computer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A new topic has a \"Send a test notification\" button, so you can see a notification arrive without a computer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Themen haben die Schaltfläche „Testnachricht senden“. Damit kannst du ohne Computer eine Benachrichtigung ausprobieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A safe topic address could not be created. Check the server and topic settings.": {
