    "New topics use %@. Any ntfy server works: turn on \"Use another server\" or change the default in Settings. Your scripts must send to %@; the same topic name on ntfy.sh is a different topic.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New topics use %@. Any ntfy server works: turn on \"Use another server\" or change the default in Settings. Your scripts must send to %@; the same topic name on ntfy.sh is a different topic."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Themen nutzen %@. Jeder ntfy-Server funktioniert: Aktiviere „Anderen Server verwenden“ oder ändere den Standard in den Einstellungen. Deine Skripte müssen an %@ senden. Derselbe Themenname auf ntfy.sh bezeichnet ein anderes Thema."
          }
        }
      }
    },
