    "Notifications older than this are permanently deleted from this device, read or unread, with downloaded attachments and matching banners in Notification Center. Age counts from the message date. Deletion runs while the app is open. Messages that just arrived and recently downloaded files are kept for an hour. Other devices are not affected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications older than this are permanently deleted from this device, read or unread, with downloaded attachments and matching banners in Notification Center. Age counts from the message date. Deletion runs while the app is open. Messages that just arrived and recently downloaded files are kept for an hour. Other devices are not affected."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ältere Benachrichtigungen werden von diesem Gerät endgültig gelöscht, gelesen oder ungelesen, einschließlich geladener Anhänge und zugehöriger Banner in der Mitteilungszentrale. Maßgeblich ist das Nachrichtendatum. Gelöscht wird bei geöffneter App. Gerade empfangene Nachrichten und kürzlich geladene Dateien bleiben eine Stunde erhalten. Andere Geräte sind nicht betroffen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
