    "Priority 4 and 5 messages are Time Sensitive. They can break through Focus and the Notification Summary when allowed in iOS settings, including your Focus settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Priority 4 and 5 messages are Time Sensitive. They can break through Focus and the Notification Summary when allowed in iOS settings, including your Focus settings."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nachrichten mit Priorität 4 und 5 sind zeitkritisch. Wenn in iOS und den Fokus-Einstellungen erlaubt, können sie Fokus und die geplante Übersicht umgehen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Priority 4 and 5 messages can now break through Focus and the Notification Summary when Time Sensitive notifications are allowed in iOS and Focus settings.": {
