    },
    "When subscribing to new topics, this server will be used as a default. Leave it empty to use %@. %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When subscribing to new topics, this server will be used as a default. Leave it empty to use %@. %@"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Server wird beim Abonnieren neuer Themen als Standard verwendet. Lass das Feld leer, um %@ zu nutzen. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a password, messages are encrypted by whoever sends them, in transit and on the server: the server, Google and Apple see only ciphertext. Once they arrive they are stored readable on this device. The password stays on this device only and isn't backed up, so a restored or new phone needs it entered again. Senders need the same password; see \"How to send encrypted messages\".": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With a password, messages are encrypted by whoever sends them, in transit and on the server: the server, Google and Apple see only ciphertext. Once they arrive they are stored readable on this device. The password stays on this device only and isn't backed up, so a restored or new phone needs it entered again. Senders need the same password; see \"How to send encrypted messages\"."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit einem Passwort verschlüsselt der Sender die Nachrichten. Bei der Übertragung und auf dem Server sehen der Server, Google und Apple nur verschlüsselte Daten. Empfangene Nachrichten werden auf diesem Gerät lesbar gespeichert. Das Passwort bleibt nur auf diesem Gerät und wird nicht gesichert. Auf einem neuen oder wiederhergestellten Telefon musst du es erneut eingeben. Sender benötigen dasselbe Passwort. Siehe „Verschlüsselte Nachrichten senden“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a title and high priority": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With a title and high priority"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit Titel und hoher Priorität"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're already subscribed to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're already subscribed to %@."
